{"unit_id":"wutian122__dsh-remote-shell#card-zh","repo":"wutian122/dsh-remote-shell","commit":"184013598dcaa5b2de37c463e61c3f84d73bb1f4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-shell 是一个面向 DSH 的远程操作技能插件，接入 DSH 的 skills provider，将随包提供的 remote-shell 技能注册到技能目录。它支持通过 SSH、Telnet 和 WinRM 执行远程命令与脚本，并可用 SFTP 上传、下载和浏览远程文件；还包含凭证库管理，可保存并复用远程主机凭证。适合需要从 DSH 管理 Linux、Windows、网络设备或 IoT 设备的用户。使用前需要安装 Python 及所用协议对应的依赖，并先准备目标主机凭证。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:13-16","lib/index.js:140-145","skills/remote-shell/scripts/ssh_execute.py:34-68","skills/remote-shell/scripts/file_transfer.py:78-107","skills/remote-shell/SKILL.md:14-23"]}
