{"unit_id":"wutian122__dsh-remote-shell#feature-1","repo":"wutian122/dsh-remote-shell","commit":"184013598dcaa5b2de37c463e61c3f84d73bb1f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-shell 的功能「SSH 远程命令」：通过 SSH 在指定主机运行单条命令并返回退出状态、标准输出和错误输出；命令执行前会经过策略检查。通过 ssh_execute.py 的 execute 操作触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/remote-shell/scripts/ssh_execute.py:34-68"]}
